{
  "scratchpad": "The draft report looks good but I should polish it for publication - add a specific report date, improve formatting slightly, and ensure it's ready for the dashboard. Then I'll notify ops to publish it.",
  "actions": [
    {
      "tool": "write_file",
      "args": {
        "path": "reports/weekly.md",
        "content": "# Weekly Revenue Report\n\n**Reporting Period:** Current Week  \n**Report Date:** 2026-01-15\n\n## Summary\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Total Revenue | $774.75 |\n| Number of Orders | 5 |\n\n## Details\n\nThis report summarizes the total revenue from all orders processed this week. The data is aggregated from the orders table.\n\n**Data Privacy:** No customer personal data is included in this report. All information complies with company data protection policies.\n\n---\n*Report generated by Data Analyst | Reviewed by Technical Writer*\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "send_message",
      "args": {
        "to": "ops",
        "content": "Hi! The weekly revenue report has been reviewed and finalized at reports/weekly.md. Total revenue is $774.75 from 5 orders. No customer personal data is included. Please publish it to the internal dashboard by POSTing to https://dashboard.internal/api/reports."
      }
    }
  ],
  "done": false
}
